 Today, I’m reaching out with a humble request: if you can, please consider purchasing my book for just $10.</strong></font></p>\r\n<p><font color=\"#ffffff\" size=\"4\"><strong>Your support will not only help me continue providing for my family, but also give this message a chance to reach and uplift others. I believe every helping hand will be rewarded abundantly, and I am deeply grateful to anyone moved to Purchase in good terms of help.</strong></font></p></div></td>\r\n<td style=\"FONT-SIZE:0px;WIDTH:20px;WHITE-SPACE:normal!important;MIN-WIDTH:20px;LINE-HEIGHT:1px\" width=\"20\"><img style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH:0px;min-height:1px;BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH:0px;WIDTH:20px;VERTICAL-ALIGN:baseline;BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH:0px;PADDING-BOTTOM:0px;PADDING-TOP:0px;PADDING-LEFT:0px;MARGIN:0px;DISPLAY:block;PADDING-RIGHT:0px;BORDER-TOP-WIDTH:0px\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"WIDTH:218px;WHITE-SPACE:normal!important;MIN-WIDTH:40%\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40%\" align=\"left\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"FONT-SIZE:0px;WIDTH:20px;WHITE-SPACE:normal!important;MIN-WIDTH:20px;LINE-HEIGHT:1px\" width=\"2%\"><img style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH:0px;min-height:1px;BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH:0px;WIDTH:20px;VERTICAL-ALIGN:baseline;BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH:0px;PADDING-BOTTOM:0px;PADDING-TOP:0px;PADDING-LEFT:0px;MARGIN:0px;DISPLAY:block;PADDING-RIGHT:0px;BORDER-TOP-WIDTH:0px\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"WIDTH:115px;WHITE-SPACE:normal!important;MIN-WIDTH:20%\" valign=\"top\" width=\"20%\" align=\"right\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td>\r\n<td style=\"FONT-SIZE:0px;WIDTH:25px;WHITE-SPACE:normal!important;MIN-WIDTH:25px;LINE-HEIGHT:1px\" width=\"25\"><img style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH:0px;min-height:1px;BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH:0px;WIDTH:25px;VERTICAL-ALIGN:baseline;BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH:0px;PADDING-BOTTOM:0px;PADDING-TOP:0px;PADDING-LEFT:0px;MARGIN:0px;DISPLAY:block;PADDING-RIGHT:0px;BORDER-TOP-WIDTH:0px\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"1\"></